---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Security + Systems — Portfolio">
  <article class="security-page">
    <header class="security-page__header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Section / security + systems</p>
      <h1>Systems that should know where they are.</h1>
      <p class="security-page__intro">Infrastructure, protocols, security, and the spaces between connected things. A public map of the systems I build, understand, and am actively developing.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="security-page__section" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Personal lab / proven ground</p>
        <h2 id="lab-title">A small environment for learning how systems fail.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="security-page__copy">
        <p>The work begins with operating systems, networks, and the discipline of making a system explainable. These are the parts I can discuss from direct configuration and use:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Proxmox virtualization with Windows and Linux guests</li>
          <li>TrueNAS, ZFS mirrors, snapshots, and layered backup practices</li>
          <li>Pi-hole network-wide DNS filtering</li>
          <li>Tailscale mesh networking with a subnet router</li>
          <li>Network segmentation for an isolated Kali environment</li>
          <li>Remote service access, documented dependencies, and architecture decision records</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="security-page__section" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Security / working posture</p>
        <h2 id="approach-title">Calibrated claims. Reproducible systems.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="security-page__copy">
        <p>I keep the boundary between implemented experience and developing knowledge visible. Security+ study is in progress; detection engineering, log analysis, and deeper adversarial lab work are being built deliberately rather than presented as finished experience.</p>
        <p>That same standard shapes the technical work: document the decision, reduce the attack surface, isolate what is experimental, and keep a recovery path when the system behaves differently than expected.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="security-page__section security-page__section--loops" aria-labelledby="loops-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Home lab / operating theory</p>
        <h2 id="loops-title">Use leaves a trail.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="security-page__copy">
        <p>A home lab is not a collection of completed diagrams. It is a set of systems that become more understandable through contact with real use, failure, recovery, and revision.</p>
        <figure class="lab-system-map" aria-labelledby="loops-caption">
          <p class="lab-system-map__label">01 → 02 / shared recovery interface</p>
          <svg class="lab-system-map__svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 560" role="img" aria-labelledby="system-map-title system-map-desc">
            <title id="system-map-title">Systems improve through use and provenance</title>
            <desc id="system-map-desc">Two circular systems loops touch at one shared recovery node. The left loop describes operational use. The right loop describes provenance.</desc>
            <defs>
              <marker id="system-use-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--earthsong-orange)" />
              </marker>
              <marker id="system-provenance-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--earthsong-green)" />
              </marker>
              <linearGradient id="recover-split" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--earthsong-orange)" />
                <stop offset="49%" stop-color="var(--earthsong-orange)" />
                <stop offset="51%" stop-color="var(--earthsong-green)" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--earthsong-green)" />
              </linearGradient>
              <filter id="signal-glow" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%">
                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="10" />
              </filter>
            </defs>
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--use lab-system-map__signal--field" cx="300" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--provenance lab-system-map__signal--field" cx="700" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--use lab-system-map__signal--trail" cx="300" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--provenance lab-system-map__signal--trail" cx="700" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--use lab-system-map__signal--halo" cx="300" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--provenance lab-system-map__signal--halo" cx="700" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--use lab-system-map__signal--glow" cx="300" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--provenance lab-system-map__signal--glow" cx="700" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" filter="url(#signal-glow)" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--use lab-system-map__signal--core" cx="300" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__signal lab-system-map__signal--provenance lab-system-map__signal--core" cx="700" cy="270" r="200" pathLength="100" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__orbit lab-system-map__orbit--use" cx="300" cy="270" r="200" />
            <circle class="lab-system-map__orbit lab-system-map__orbit--provenance" cx="700" cy="270" r="200" />
            <text class="lab-system-map__center lab-system-map__center--large" x="300" y="260" text-anchor="middle">SYSTEMS IMPROVE</text>
            <text class="lab-system-map__center" x="300" y="290" text-anchor="middle">THROUGH USE</text>
            <text class="lab-system-map__center lab-system-map__center--large" x="700" y="260" text-anchor="middle">SYSTEMS IMPROVE</text>
            <text class="lab-system-map__center" x="700" y="290" text-anchor="middle">THROUGH PROVENANCE</text>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -2.6s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-orange);" transform="translate(362 80)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="0" y="-42" text-anchor="middle">CONFIGURE</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -4.2s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-orange);" transform="translate(138 152)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="-38" y="6" text-anchor="end">OPERATE</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -5.8s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-orange);" transform="translate(138 388)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="-38" y="6" text-anchor="end">OBSERVE</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -7.4s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-orange);" transform="translate(362 460)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="0" y="48" text-anchor="middle">REVISE</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -7.4s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-green);" transform="translate(638 80)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="0" y="-42" text-anchor="middle">DECISION</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -5.8s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-green);" transform="translate(862 152)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="38" y="6">CHANGE</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -4.2s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-green);" transform="translate(862 388)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="38" y="6">EVIDENCE</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__node lab-system-map__node--pulse" style="--node-delay: -2.6s; --node-glow: var(--earthsong-green);" transform="translate(638 460)">
              <circle r="25" /><circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" /><text x="0" y="48" text-anchor="middle">CONTEXT</text>
            </g>
            <g class="lab-system-map__shared-node" transform="translate(500 270)">
              <circle class="lab-system-map__shared-ring" r="38" />
              <circle class="lab-system-map__shared-core" r="27" />
              <circle class="lab-system-map__dot" r="5" />
              <text x="0" y="-52" text-anchor="middle">RECOVER</text>
              <text class="lab-system-map__shared-id" x="0" y="58" text-anchor="middle">R / SHARED</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
          <figcaption id="loops-caption">Use teaches the system. Provenance explains the change.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="security-page__artifact-note">Exports, decisions, restore notes, and test results keep both loops legible.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="security-page__section" aria-labelledby="artifacts-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Practice artifacts</p>
        <h2 id="artifacts-title">The evidence is being written down.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="security-page__artifacts">
        <article>
          <p class="security-page__artifact-label">01 / implemented</p>
          <h3>Trust boundaries</h3>
          <p>Proxmox hosts Windows and Linux guests; TrueNAS provides storage and recovery layers; Pi-hole filters DNS; Tailscale provides identity-based remote access; an isolated Kali environment is kept off the LAN by design.</p>
          <p class="security-page__artifact-note">The public version intentionally omits addresses, credentials, and topology details that would make the home network easier to target.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <p class="security-page__artifact-label">02 / implemented posture</p>
          <h3>Recovery before confidence</h3>
          <p>Mirrored storage, snapshots, layered backups, configuration exports, and an offline target turn failure into a recoverable event rather than a story about hoping nothing breaks.</p>
          <p class="security-page__artifact-note">The next public version will document one restore exercise with timing, assumptions, and what was not recoverable.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <p class="security-page__artifact-label">03 / next build</p>
          <h3>Detection in the loop</h3>
          <p>The remaining gap is detection evidence: collect sanitized host and network events, generate a controlled signal, and write the triage from alert to conclusion without presenting planned work as shipped capability.</p>
          <p class="security-page__artifact-note">Wazuh, Windows event logs, and a small ATT&amp;CK-mapped exercise are the intended next lab boundary.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="security-page__section security-page__section--last" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Where this connects</p>
        <h2 id="fit-title">Useful at the boundary between people and systems.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="security-page__copy">
        <p>My background combines customer-facing operations, data analytics, web development, documentation, and hands-on infrastructure. I am interested in roles where careful communication and technical curiosity matter as much as the tool list.</p>
        <a class="security-page__cta" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .security-page { max-width: 90rem; min-width: 0; margin-inline: auto; padding-top: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 8rem); }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 12ch; margin-block: 1rem 2rem; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 11vw, 9rem); line-height: .84; letter-spacing: -.07em; }
  h2 { max-width: 15ch; margin-block: .75rem 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); line-height: .95; }
  .security-page__header { max-width: 66rem; }
  .security-page__intro { max-width: 46rem; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem); }
  .security-page__section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, .8fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem); align-items: start; margin-top: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 10rem); padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; }
  .security-page__copy { max-width: 42rem; }
  .security-page__copy p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .security-page__copy ul { display: grid; gap: .75rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .security-page__copy li { padding-top: .75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--earthsong-muted); }
  .security-page__artifacts { display: grid; gap: 1rem; max-width: 46rem; }
  .security-page__artifacts article { padding: 1rem 0 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; }
  .security-page__artifacts article:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; }
  .security-page__artifacts h3 { margin: .35rem 0 .75rem; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 400; }
  .security-page__artifacts p { margin: 0; }
  .security-page__artifact-label { color: var(--earthsong-orange); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .security-page__artifact-note { margin-top: .8rem !important; color: var(--earthsong-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .security-page__section--loops { align-items: start; }
  .lab-system-map { margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--earthsong-muted); }
  .lab-system-map__label { margin: 0; color: var(--earthsong-orange); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lab-system-map__svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: .75rem; overflow: visible; }
  .lab-system-map__orbit { fill: none; stroke: var(--earthsong-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  .lab-system-map__orbit--use, .lab-system-map__orbit--provenance { stroke: var(--earthsong-muted); stroke-opacity: .8; }
  .lab-system-map__direction { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.5; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  .lab-system-map__direction--use { stroke: var(--earthsong-orange); }
  .lab-system-map__direction--provenance { stroke: var(--earthsong-green); }
  .lab-system-map__signal { fill: none; stroke-linecap: round; animation: lab-signal-travel 8s linear infinite; }
  .lab-system-map__signal--field { stroke-width: 5; stroke-dasharray: 22 78; opacity: .1; animation-name: lab-signal-travel-field; }
  .lab-system-map__signal--trail { stroke-width: 4; stroke-dasharray: 16 84; opacity: .2; animation-name: lab-signal-travel-trail; }
  .lab-system-map__signal--halo { stroke-width: 3; stroke-dasharray: 10 90; opacity: .42; animation-name: lab-signal-travel-halo; }
  .lab-system-map__signal--glow { stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 6 94; opacity: .8; animation-name: lab-signal-travel-glow; }
  .lab-system-map__signal--core { stroke-width: 1; stroke-linecap: butt; stroke-dasharray: 5 95; opacity: .9; }
  .lab-system-map__signal--use { stroke: var(--earthsong-orange); }
  .lab-system-map__signal--provenance { stroke: var(--earthsong-green); animation-delay: -4s; }
  .lab-system-map__center { fill: var(--earthsong-foreground); font-family: var(--font-micro); font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .lab-system-map__center--large { fill: var(--earthsong-cream); font-size: 22px; }
  .lab-system-map__node circle:first-child { fill: var(--earthsong-background); stroke: var(--earthsong-foreground); stroke-width: 1.5; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  .lab-system-map__dot { fill: var(--earthsong-foreground); }
  .lab-system-map__node text, .lab-system-map__shared-node text { fill: var(--earthsong-foreground); font-family: var(--font-micro); font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
  .lab-system-map__node--use circle:first-child { fill: var(--earthsong-orange); stroke: var(--earthsong-orange); }
  .lab-system-map__node--use .lab-system-map__dot { fill: var(--earthsong-background); }
  .lab-system-map__node--provenance circle:first-child { fill: var(--earthsong-green); stroke: var(--earthsong-green); }
  .lab-system-map__node--provenance .lab-system-map__dot { fill: var(--earthsong-background); }
  .lab-system-map__node--pulse circle:first-child, .lab-system-map__node--pulse .lab-system-map__dot { animation: lab-node-light 8s linear infinite; animation-delay: var(--node-delay); }
  .lab-system-map__shared-ring { fill: var(--earthsong-background); stroke: url(#recover-split); stroke-width: 2; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; animation: lab-recovery-pulse 8s ease-in-out -.35s infinite; }
  .lab-system-map__shared-core { fill: url(#recover-split); stroke: var(--earthsong-cream); stroke-width: 1; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  .lab-system-map__shared-node .lab-system-map__dot { fill: var(--earthsong-background); }
  .lab-system-map__shared-core { animation: lab-recovery-core-pulse 8s ease-in-out -.35s infinite; }
  .lab-system-map__shared-node .lab-system-map__dot { animation: lab-recovery-dot-pulse 8s ease-in-out -.35s infinite; }
  .lab-system-map__shared-node text:first-of-type { fill: var(--earthsong-cream); font-size: 17px; }
  .lab-system-map__shared-id { fill: var(--earthsong-green) !important; font-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1px !important; }
  @keyframes lab-signal-travel {
    from { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    to { stroke-dashoffset: -100; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-signal-travel-trail {
    from { stroke-dashoffset: 5; }
    to { stroke-dashoffset: -95; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-signal-travel-halo {
    from { stroke-dashoffset: 4.5; }
    to { stroke-dashoffset: -95.5; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-signal-travel-glow {
    from { stroke-dashoffset: 2; }
    to { stroke-dashoffset: -98; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-signal-travel-field {
    from { stroke-dashoffset: 7; }
    to { stroke-dashoffset: -93; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-node-light {
    0%, 3%, 14%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent); opacity: 1; }
    5%, 10% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px var(--node-glow)); opacity: 1; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-recovery-pulse {
    0%, 5%, 95%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    12%, 88% { opacity: .7; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-recovery-core-pulse {
    0%, 7%, 93%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 14px var(--earthsong-cream)); stroke-width: 3; opacity: 1; }
    18%, 82% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent); stroke-width: 1; opacity: .9; }
  }
  @keyframes lab-recovery-dot-pulse {
    0%, 7%, 93%, 100% { fill: var(--earthsong-cream); }
    18%, 82% { fill: var(--earthsong-background); }
  }
  .lab-system-map figcaption { max-width: 42rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--earthsong-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .security-page__section--last { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .security-page__cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .security-page__section { display: block; }
    .security-page__copy { margin-top: 2rem; }
    .lab-system-map { overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: .5rem; }
    .lab-system-map__svg { min-width: 42rem; }
    .lab-system-map__center { font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .lab-system-map__center--large { font-size: 18px; }
    .lab-system-map__node text, .lab-system-map__shared-node text { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .lab-system-map__orbit { stroke-dasharray: none; }
    .lab-system-map__signal { animation: none; stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    .lab-system-map__node--pulse circle:first-child, .lab-system-map__node--pulse .lab-system-map__dot { animation: none; filter: none; }
    .lab-system-map__shared-ring { animation: none; opacity: .85; }
    .lab-system-map__shared-core, .lab-system-map__shared-node .lab-system-map__dot { animation: none; filter: none; }
  }
</style>
